# WorldVision Summons: Codex Page Finalizer

The generator is the mutable workshop. A finalized Codex Page is an immutable, deterministic, print-ready artifact (A4 portrait, illuminated manuscript / equipment plate).

Do not write the sealed page back into `UiSheetData`. Do not call `Date.now()` inside normalize, compose, hash, or export. The caller supplies `finalizedAt` and `snapshotId`. `provenance.sourceHash` is SHA-256 of canonical JSON with sorted keys, excluding `sourceHash`.

## 1. Data schema (`src/features/codex/schema/`)

`CodexSnapshotV1`:

- `schemaVersion`: `"codex.snapshot.v1"`
- `snapshotId`: UUID
- `characterId`: string
- `revision`: integer, starting at 1 for the first sealed artifact
- `finalizedAt`: ISO 8601
- `template`: `{ id: "illuminated-codex"; version: "1.0.0" }`
- `identity`: `{ name, classTitle, faction?, motto? }`
- `portrait`: `PinnedPortraitAsset | null` with `assetId`, `renditionUrl`, `width`, `height`, `mimeType`, `contentHash`, `focalPoint`, `cropRect` (fractions 0..1)
- `physical`: `{ silhouette?, marks, height?, weight? }`
- `psychology`: traits in categories reputation, virtue, vice, fear, loyalty, survival, obsession, tell, blindSpot
- `combat`: `{ hp, maxHp, ac, initiative, speed }`
- `attributes`: str, dex, con, int, wis, cha, each `{ score, modifier }`
- `resources`, `proficiencies`, `equipment` (`target` head | torso | leftHand | rightHand | waist | feet | free, `priority` 1 | 2 | 3)
- `chronicle`: `{ backstorySummary, notes? }`
- `relations`, `visual.genreTheme`, `provenance.sourceHash`

Normalization: trim strings and turn `""` into `null`. Clamp attributes and vitals. Never copy OAuth tokens, `blob:` URLs, private prompts, or chat history.

## 2. Geometry and tokens

A4 `210mm x 297mm`. Safe margin `12mm`. Title `22mm`. Body `188mm`: identity `35mm`, portrait `95mm`, gear `37mm`. Bottom system `50mm`. Footer `8mm`.

Palette: Ink `#211813`, Oxblood `#6B3324`, Gilded Bronze `#B37B3D`, Aged Fiber `#DBC69F`, Parchment `#F2E7CF`. Display 24–42pt. Labels 7.5–9pt. Body minimum 8pt. Rules 0.4–1.2pt.

The plate is a manuscript, not a dashboard. Ground is mottled parchment with a burnt edge and a full-bleed double rule plus corner ornaments. The portrait is the hero and sits slightly desaturated. Gear callouts are a vignette, a small-caps name, and one italic line, joined by fine rules. A heraldic crest sits at the top of the identity rail. Empty portrait, crest, or item art is an engraved sigil. Empty fields omit their panel. Reference sheets in `references/codex-examples/` are composition only. Never copy their names, stats, items, or lore.

## 3. Composition

`composeCodex(snapshot, templateManifest, outputProfile)`.

- Name target 24 characters, hard max 42, two lines when condensed.
- Class target 44, max 72.
- Motto longer than 90 characters moves into the chronicle.
- Up to 6 traits, pinned first, then Reputation, Virtue, Vice, Fear, Loyalty, Survival. Description max 140.
- Missing portrait renders an engraved frame labeled "Portrait not set".
- Up to 6 equipment items. Empty slots collapse. Never print "None".
- Vitals and the six attributes with modifiers stay visible.
- Chronicle is an extractive 3-beat summary, target 480, hard max 720.
- Footer: `Revision {n} • Template: {id}@{version} • Hash: {sourceHash.slice(0, 8)} • Finalized {YYYY-MM-DD}`.
- Leaders are orthogonal, one bend, 0.6pt. If an anchor collides or a line would cross the face, drop the leaders and keep the equipment plate.

## 4. Review flow

Phases: `editing -> reviewing -> snapshotting -> composing -> ready -> exporting -> ready`.

Blocking errors (missing name, missing class/title, invalid stats) disable Finalize. Warnings (missing crest, empty traits, low-resolution portrait) stay non-blocking and offer Edit section. The workshop stays editable. The next seal is the next revision.

`CodexPreviewShell` scales the fixed `210mm x 297mm` page with `transform: scale()`. Do not reflow text inside the page.

## 5. Export

Filename: `worldvision-[slug]-codex-r[revision]-[yyyy-mm-dd].[ext]`.

JSON is the snapshot. PNG is 2480×3508 for A4. PDF is print-ready A4 (`210mm 297mm`, zero margin), with US Letter as a scaled output profile of the same composition.

Mount from `App.tsx` with `CodexFinalizer`, passing the live `UiSheetData` workshop sheet.
